{{!
    @template theme_erasight/banner

    A small "Welcome back" style banner — the shared, simpler counterpart to
    hero.mustache (which has CTA buttons and stats, meant for the front
    page). Used by layout/mydashboard.php and layout/mycourses.php; the
    Admin Home page inlines the same two fields directly in its own
    template rather than including this one, since a plugin-owned template
    including a template from a different component wasn't worth verifying
    for a four-line block.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "greeting": "Welcome back, Priya",
        "tagline": "Pick up where you left off."
    }
}}
<div class="erasight-banner">
    <h2 class="erasight-banner-title">{{greeting}}</h2>
    <p class="erasight-banner-tagline">{{tagline}}</p>
</div>
